al camera layout is very clean and  almost everyone will love it one thing  that'll be very interesting to test out  is the new matte glass finish on the  back of the 11pro so we'll have to see  which phone feels more premium in the  hand the cameras themselves are  outstanding on the note 10 plus and my  opinion is the best camera on any  smartphone out there so I have to see if  the  improvements to the iPhone 11 pros  cameras will bring it back to the top  the iPhone 10s already records the best  video quality you can get on a  smartphone so I'm glad Apple is further  pushing their lead in this area with the  iPhone 11 Pro we'll be doing an in-depth  photo night mode and video quality  comparison when we get our hands on the  phones so make sure to subscribe right  now so you don't miss out a huge bonus  for the galaxy is the USB C port which  we still don't get on the iPhone and of  course you get the S Pen with the no  allowing for easy sketching note-taking  and document signing as far as the  displays it seems like Samsung is  supplying a very similar display for  both the note 10 plus and the iPhone 11  Pro with the same 1200 nits of peak  brightness the same two million to one  contrast and the same color accuracy  however the notes and plus has a higher  1440p resolution and it features an  always-on display which is a huge bonus  over the iPhone so it definitely has the  more pro display the note 10 plus also  has a larger battery 4300 milliamp hours  compared to 3500 on the 11pro Macs  so it seems like it should have better  battery life mister who's the boss ran a  battery life test and when the iPhone  tennis max died the note 10 plus was at  19 percent battery life however the note  was only at 1080p resolution instead of  1440p on top of that the always-on  display would use up some battery life  in the real world and since Apple showed  off a massive battery life improvement  with the iPhone 11 pro max there's a  very good chance that it could beat 